# Generated reports are rebuilt by scripts/run_dataset.R.
reports/*.txt

# Frozen snapshots are derived from the inputs and are rebuilt on first run by
# resolve_source(), so they are not carried in the repo. Where `arrow` is
# unavailable, rebuild them with the two bridge scripts (see README).
snapshots/

# The raw export and the join CSV are supplied per run, not carried here.
# configs/ name the paths they expect under data/. The reference .parquet pair
# is still tracked; drop it the same way if you want data/ empty of inputs too.
data/*.txt
data/*.TXT
data/*.csv
